{"title":"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of all the solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f2ff20665ba333547d6ab7a4b5c3de71ec30a31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\left|2x-|60-2x|\\right|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/f/f9fd4b80ff9df85b040285e38acb6f963653e0ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 32 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 60 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 92 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 120 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 124$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We evaluate this in cases:\n</p><p><i>Case 1</i>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b5fdb8e401d5a15d14d77e0c22e0cda6f09d54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;30$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b5fdb8e401d5a15d14d77e0c22e0cda6f09d54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;30$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> we are going to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2e1a0da7ba493213579252b0a1e2bfabbaab6f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-2x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />.  When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> we are going to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2abd8287a4224ac51ecdee7bbbff038e1efabca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|&gt;0\\implies x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" /> and when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/7690cc5b82324b605e2deeadb933cdd7959775ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> we are going to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99aa8af23c45d189e4148c6d84fb72b9ef5479a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|&gt;0\\implies -x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" />.  Therefore we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc1d3953a1501775ef2399942076b509221d4ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|2x-(60-2x)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/8/048b88559008f9da73eb7a7c073a8b1ed62d73b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|2x-60+2x|\\implies x=|4x-60|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"298\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><i>Subcase 1 </i><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe6ff21d707e32f97031ca6a554c92061af18b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30&gt;x&gt;15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe6ff21d707e32f97031ca6a554c92061af18b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30&gt;x&gt;15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" /> we are going to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d34e8f319df3f31ec3e8572f503a884f54f210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x-60&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />. When this happens, we can express <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541815e380af6b8c31a4c1f4d3779f80d4cdc88a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4x-60|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/e/38ef0c1a68f4490fb89d33ddf9fdec2fb494994b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x-60$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />.\nTherefore we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/8/198dd0fc25a4e001b0a3bca0732a9478fc9912a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4x-60\\implies -3x=-60\\implies x=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"336\" height=\"13\" />.  We check if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf1342f460285dfd226094ac3973558576c9982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> is in the domain of the numbers that we put into this subcase, and it is, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac66fb4e76bfd9facccb4a4ebfe3ebc126a8b0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30&gt;20&gt;15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is one possible solution.  \n</p><p><i> Subcase 2 </i> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704ba6849575779e2bfdebd0b1607344ee852577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704ba6849575779e2bfdebd0b1607344ee852577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> we are going to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/9/979fcd1e6b3877cffb0cd28b76d9d8f1b103bc9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x-60&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541815e380af6b8c31a4c1f4d3779f80d4cdc88a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4x-60|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/52322520ae09503c9d2af7fd3a50a3f49fd8bebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />.\nWe have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e85ff592b99c98ec755cd237c7d1069da0912d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60-4x\\implies 5x=60\\implies x=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"307\" height=\"13\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is another possible solution.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/707b2e898da40a17b8bd9e12cf06c3d299bf7b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|2x-|60-2x||$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><i>Case 2 </i>:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0514d2a96cfa22637b6c23769ac931a0dd82603e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;30$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0514d2a96cfa22637b6c23769ac931a0dd82603e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;30$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf3f34f82112c090d2927af1b24e6d5adbaa969f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-2x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> we can express this in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dacf3632e35e3df121360cf6e8e47be937ec76e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(60-2x)=2x-60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />.  This makes sure that this is positive, since we just took the negative of a negative to get a positive.  Therefore we have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6c5206155db22bd192fce664717f4217e63d161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|2x-(2x-60)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369aa53d20815ba6d7575b3e4ea96138263d97f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|2x-2x+60|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df83d8b108283b7088617f0eac01ee66d0d2192c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|60|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43fe0b5d105ca27faf685588f5682110c5e78f21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We have now evaluated all the cases, and found the solution to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/5424a1640af76b14e8854a7a3c35cb5031c74f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{60,12,20\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> which have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da25e7283fe43ae90aff069326aac4a37bd5adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 92}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f2ff20665ba333547d6ab7a4b5c3de71ec30a31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\left|2x-|60-2x|\\right|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" /> , we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16d1da212951c8656478b097fc8bca825fb5b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2x-|60-2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> , or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755ae6066fc92a79ddb2b1217b0ff12ddedef6a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x = 2x-|60-2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/6/0f69726a37c6d4addb8f1fa962feb716f9801378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=|60-2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> , or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/4/2842f7f7588d3c92dfca1f9b0d9e6cf4b299bbfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=|60-2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />. From here we have four possible cases:\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d29333f1df172ccedd9b1f767a31a9879261662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60-2x$\" width=\"94\" height=\"12\" />; this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/3303641da2aa9acafa4e52b7b15cb190be79604d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=60$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf1342f460285dfd226094ac3973558576c9982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae713a11c76464a8657d76afc50307059753ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x=60-2x$\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" />; this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43fe0b5d105ca27faf685588f5682110c5e78f21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/1/d0151d9b44c73d875b5c6aff4453585acbbcaf90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=60-2x$\" width=\"103\" height=\"12\" />; this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/7/f57b5d7d28b26fe161ba876436ee9fab57048a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=60$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fce41465f6ac44f0c78fbacabb9cb5e9682f9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc931469cad1bb0d1c56ed7b28b2dd3f2ba0cd29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3x=60-2x$\" width=\"117\" height=\"12\" />; this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20197d09edf3f98b56761014dc0f96e6a14e957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x=60$\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/2/c62d3fcc27aa677aa13958cf4462efa7f08c5a1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-60$\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" />. However, this solution is extraneous because the absolute value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9db8530ad3df8452be8c925d7e775c3164df12a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-|60-2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> cannot be negative.\n</p><p>The sum of all of the solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/4/9547a00296ebd11a090828cf4e86546224b7d295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20+60+12=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 92}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vYXz4wStBUU?t=272\">https://youtu.be/vYXz4wStBUU?t=272</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1DjO74VEr3E\">https://youtu.be/1DjO74VEr3E</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B\">2010 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems